# Sibling projects that live in this same folder but are separate,
# unrelated apps (see project memory) - must never be uploaded into this
# Vercel deployment. Found the hard way: hybrid_lab/api/splice.py showed up
# as a candidate Python entrypoint during a real deploy attempt, because
# this whole directory gets uploaded to Vercel regardless of .gitignore/git
# tracking status - .vercelignore is the only thing that actually excludes it.
hybrid_lab/
in_silico_avel/
